Funning (Mac, desktop package 09a1b8e):
- The bottom 「暂停旅程」 button (cancelVisit during region-loading/region-travel) is gone. cancelVisit stays only for
  skycity-loading (取消前往), which is not the journey cutscene.
- The strip under it was the Boot's notice plate (#123233 LabelPlate at bottom+55: 正在准备… / 沿着彩虹… / 快到了… /
  旅程已暂停… / 旅程暂时受阻…). There is no separate debug-notes overlay; the plate and every use of it are removed.
- ui/DevPreviewMark.ts: one bare Label 「开发预览画面，不代表最终效果」, 10 pt, white α150, right-aligned bottom-right,
  12 pt inside the safe area (boardSafeInsets: home bar / landscape notch), far from the top-right capsule; only while
  the cutscene is on screen. No Button, no BlockInputEvents, no touch listener: taps pass through.
  Shown when DEBUG (cc/env) is set, or on WeChat when envVersion is develop/trial (devtools, 开发版, 体验版), or on web;
  hidden on envVersion release or when it cannot be read. DEBUG alone is not enough: the desktop/test package is
  built with tools/build-guard/wechat-release.json (debug false).
- Pausing: no button and no tap-to-pause (a tap never pauses; lead: players would think it froze). Background is
  the only pause (existing WorldFlow.hide suspends the journey); on return the Boot resumes it by itself through the
  same path as 「继续」 (composition.resumeJourney), once, after any busy invoke, with no 「继续」 flash. Island and
  error returns are unchanged (「继续」 / no auto-resume).
- New test journey-cutscene-ui (in run-suite): five viewports x loading/approach/bridge/arrival, no button/strip, the
  dev line is the only text, its geometry, zero listeners, taps change nothing, auto-resume (with and without a painted
  hidden frame), release flag rules.
